    <!-- <SS:Nexii> Atmo Magic: Atmosphere > Atmosphere sub-tab. The
         parameter set, row order and grouping mirror EEP's own Atmosphere
         panel (panel_settings_sky_atmos.xml) - colours, then the
         haze/density block read left column first - ranges included, the
         difference being that every one of them is keyframable. The
         PBR-era dials (sky moisture, droplet radius, ice, probe
         ambiance) are here in EEP's own positions. Sun/moon azimuth and
         elevation are deliberately absent from this tab family: position
         is the Planetary tab job, computed from the home body, so these
         panels only ever say what the light looks like, never where it
         comes from. -->

